## User Stories

### US-9.1: Create and maintain sports

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** create and maintain sports supported by the system  
**So that** the system can categorize leagues by sport  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Create a sport with a valid name and verify that it appears in the list.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-9.2: View available sports

**As a** data user  
**I want to** view the sports available in the system  
**So that** I can select the correct sport when reviewing leagues  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Open the sports list and verify that all saved sports are displayed.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-9.3: Prevent duplicate sports

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** prevent duplicate sport records  
**So that** the sport list remains consistent  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Attempt to create a duplicate sport name and verify that the system rejects it.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

